# Leave everything out of the image...
*

# ...except the three things the app needs to run.
!requirements.txt
!moonlight/
!web/

# This leaves out tests/, fixtures/, docs/, .git, tickets/, scripts/ and
# any .env file. Caches are left out even inside the folders kept above.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.moonlight-cache/
